      "text": "The village was renamed Thebes in 1843, echoing the ancient Egyptian capital, a nod to local rock formations that resembled Nile Valley scenery.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
